WEBVTT

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:16.650
Let's go.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.020
<i>The Beast Hunter...</i>

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:28.720
<i>The one who kills Incarnates, 
Beasts who were once regarded as heroes.</i>

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:31.840
<i>I'm currently traveling with him.</i>

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:53.540
You two are soaked.

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:55.080
Get in the wagon.

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:01.580
Um... Thank you for doing this.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:05.310
Well, aren't you a polite young lady?

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:08.270
So, where are you two headed?

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:09.420
Um...

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:11.290
Roguehill.

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:14.730
Roguehill? Are you serious?

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:16.460
But that place is...

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:18.930
What kind of place is it?

00:01:19.270 --> 00:01:22.290
There's a monster in that town.

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:26.770
And because of it, the place 
is still stuck in the war.

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:28.760
Look, you can see it up ahead.

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:33.300
That's Roguehill, the town 
where the war never ends.

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:08.950
The Minotaur's Fortress

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.840
What in the world is that thing?

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:21.340
It's a fortress.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:22.610
A fortress?

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:24.800
You're finally here!

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:27.090
Took you long enough.

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:30.720
You should never make a lady 
wait, Hank. You'll regret it.

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:37.380
C-Can I help you?

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:41.810
Listen, sweetie. I have 
important business with him.

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:44.940
If you're lost, you should 
get someone else to help.

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.030
Lost?!

00:03:46.300 --> 00:03:47.370
She's not lost?

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:56.110
Sorry about that. My name is Liza.

00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:58.100
I support Hank.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.080
I may not look it, but I'm in the military.

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:02.040
I'm Schaal...

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:06.120
Now, then... Let's get down to business.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.890
You saw that fortress, didn't you?

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:14.010
It was built by Minotaur, an Incarnate.

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:18.930
He's a fortress-building specialist who's good 
with his hands and has superhuman strength.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:22.690
I heard that, during the war, he built 
a fortress in just three days...

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:25.950
But I'm sure you know more 
about this than I do.

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:30.600
After the war, he came back 
to this town, his home.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:34.830
Then, one day, he just started 
building the fortress.

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:37.630
The fortress grows larger by the day,

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:41.730
and he keeps destroying the nearby 
buildings for more materials.

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:45.750
The longer this goes on, 
the more damage this town will take.

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:47.910
We have to stop him quickly.

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:50.270
Are you going to kill him, too?

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:52.700
Because he's an Incarnate?

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:56.020
What's her deal?

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:59.060
Her father was an Incarnate.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:04:59.750
Huh?

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:04.020
You're going to kill that 
Incarnate, aren't you?

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:05.680
Why do you have to kill him?

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:07.430
If that fortress is a problem,

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:10.230
then we should just convince 
him to stop building it!

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:13.740
And yet... you're treating him like a nuisance...

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:17.110
That's just... wrong.

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:19.670
I can't accept that!

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:23.210
There must be another way! A better way!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.090
Convince him, huh?

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:27.170
That is certainly a fine idea.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:29.850
If only it were possible...

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:36.640
It's begun.

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:41.270
The time to do battle is nigh! 
Citizens, prepare yourselves!

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.400
Prepare for war!

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:47.210
Have you forgotten the flames 
that burned down our homeland,

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:49.600
the remains of our fallen friends,

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:52.280
the murderous eyes of our enemies?!

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:55.150
Their menacing bayonets?!

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:56.540
Build up walls!

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.470
Close the gates!

00:05:58.470 --> 00:06:01.920
Store up provisions and polish your rifles!

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.790
Where is this "enemy" even supposed to be?

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:05.170
Only those aware of their mortality will survive!

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:05.170
But the war's already over...

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:07.810
Be prepared! Be prepared for battle!

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:07.810
How long is this going to continue?

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:10.430
This is their daily life.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:13.110
He's still fighting a battle...

00:06:13.110 --> 00:06:15.690
and dragging everyone in this town into it.

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:24.200
Did you get what I asked for?

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:26.210
I'll bring it to your room later.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:27.990
I'll make my move at nightfall.

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:43.600
Looks like that really got to you.

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.070
Why...

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:46.830
Huh?

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:52.560
He also fought to protect 
these people and this town.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:55.880
That's why the war ended...

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:59.590
I just don't understand.

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:02.710
Come with me.

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:09.090
What is this?

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:11.830
These are the people who lost their 
homes so he could build his fortress.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:15.000
The people who have nowhere 
else to go live here now.

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:20.610
It's true... that we have this peace 
now because of the Incarnates.

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:21.390
But you see...

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:26.380
Protecting the livelihoods 
of these people is our job.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:46.150
Why is he up there all by himself?

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.590
What is it that he's fighting?

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:49.810
I don't know.

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:54.450
The only ones who can understand Incarnates 
are those who share the same fate.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:55.690
What's that?

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:57.850
This is what Hank asked me to get him.

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:01.400
These are no ordinary bullets.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:04.080
They can take the lives of Incarnates.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:06.000
They're Godkiller bullets.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.280
These are replicas.

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:12.390
They aren't as powerful as the originals, 
but they're effective enough.

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:16.910
I wonder how he feels
when he has to use these.

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:55.860
What's wrong?!

00:08:57.920 --> 00:08:59.720
Elaine...

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:08.710
Elaine!

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:16.330
You, um... looked like you 
were having a nightmare.

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:21.030
Did I say anything?

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:24.350
No... Nothing.

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:25.740
I see.

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:38.560
So you're really going to go?

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:39.760
Yes.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:43.890
A fight is what he wants.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.460
Are you really coming with me?

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:55.370
I won't cause you any trouble.

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:57.470
I'll protect myself.

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:01.040
Stay close to me.

00:10:06.070 --> 00:10:09.710
He built all this... by himself?

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:12.140
He had infinite time and materials,

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:16.100
and he was able to build it
without interference from anyone.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:18.970
If you wander in with no knowledge of it...

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.550
Those are security guards who tried to enter.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:55.030
Don't walk anywhere except where I walk.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:06.210
Um... What was he like?

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:08.360
The man who made this fortress, I mean.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.170
He was a very cowardly man.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:14.350
Everything frightened him
and made him panic.

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:17.940
His name was Theo. Theodore Sherman.

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:24.670
Theo... You scared?

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:26.020
What about you?

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:29.290
Aren't you scared, Captain?

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:35.930
I don't want to end up like them...

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:37.660
I don't want to die like that!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.250
I'm scared, too.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:43.290
So I do this.

00:11:43.990 --> 00:11:46.730
I want to know I've done all I could.

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:50.440
That's why I prepare before 
a battle to allay my fear.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:54.130
Theo, what are you doing right now?

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:58.930
I... I'm...

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.940
<i>I taught him this...</i>

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:11.780
What's wrong?

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:13.770
Stay right there.

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:14.500
Huh?

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:21.980
You stay there.

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:24.790
I'll continue ahead on my own.

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:26.580
On your own?

00:12:26.580 --> 00:12:30.720
Please wait, Hank! I'll go with you!

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:35.110
No...

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:39.100
He never had any intention 
of bringing you along.

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:41.620
Liza?

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:43.470
You've had enough now, haven't you?

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:46.290
Go any further and you really will die.

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:48.660
Were you following us this whole time?

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.040
Yes. I followed you both in...

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:53.290
so that I could take you back.

00:12:53.740 --> 00:12:55.440
Because Hank asked me to.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:56.180
Huh?

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:58.270
Now that that's settled, we're heading back.

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:00.320
Don't worry.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:02.960
I'll get you back safer 
than even Hank expected.

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:03.710
Hey!

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:05.910
I want to know...

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:09.230
I want to know what Hank is trying to do.

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:14.430
I... can't forgive him.

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:17.900
That's why I want to 
understand what he's doing.

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:21.070
I need to see it with my own eyes!

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:24.360
That's why I have to go!

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:27.730
I need to stay by Hank! I...

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:37.580
Wh-Wh-Wh-What are you doing, Liza?!

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:41.420
Just shaking that thing isn't 
going to open it, you know.

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:43.980
Usually, with these things...

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:54.880
Well, you're going to Hank, aren't you?

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.690
Liza...

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:58.420
Yes!

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:11.120
Captain!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.840
Welcome, Captain Hank!

00:14:16.300 --> 00:14:18.680
I didn't expect you to come!

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.580
Just look at this fortress!

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:27.490
Our squad has split up,
 but I've built this giant fortress!

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:31.670
Now we won't have to fear any enemy!

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:34.150
Where's this so-called enemy?

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:36.320
They're all over the place!

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:39.160
They're targeting us from 
the shadows, even now!

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:43.150
They sneak up on me in the guise 
of children, with eyes that see all!

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:45.280
No matter how thick I make these walls,

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:48.410
no matter how many traps I set, 
they're still coming to kill me!

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:51.880
I need to make a much, much bigger fortress!

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:53.690
A powerful fortress!

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:56.420
Otherwise, they're going to...

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:57.530
They're going to—

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:02.550
Let's end this, Theo.

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:04.340
Captain...

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:09.710
Don't tell me... that you've betrayed me...

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:12.080
But we fought side by side...

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:16.490
That's right!

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:20.200
I'm the enemy that's come to kill you!

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:21.700
My enemy?

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:24.900
I see... Finally...

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:26.310
Finally...

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:29.640
An enemy has appeared!

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:34.040
I prepared myself for any kind of enemy!

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:36.280
You're the one who taught me that the way

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:38.740
to overcome fear is to always be prepared!

00:15:57.410 --> 00:15:59.850
It's impressive that you could dodge that!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.500
However...

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:08.640
I told you! I've prepared for anything!

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.930
Looks like it's already begun.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:20.470
Let's hurry. You want to see 
what Hank is doing, right?

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:21.420
Yes!

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:24.030
Um, Liza...

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:26.590
Hank's also an Incarnate, right?

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:27.600
He is.

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:30.990
But... he looks like a normal person.

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:34.650
What kind of Incarnate is Hank?

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:36.050
He's...

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:45.640
Hank!

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:53.960
Please stop!

00:16:53.960 --> 00:16:57.650
Didn't you fight side by side? Please!

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:58.140
It's no use.

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:01.130
He lost his mind long ago.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.510
Besides, Hank will be just fine.

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:14.000
Huh?

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:33.980
He's one of the few Incarnates who 
only reveals his true powers at night.

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:43.660
His name is...

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:46.520
Werewolf!

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:08.560
No...

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:14.030
I... don't want to die.

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:18.460
I don't want to die like that!

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:20.180
That's why I prepared myself!

00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:22.230
So I can overcome my fear!

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:25.410
And yet, it just doesn't end!

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.560
No matter how big I build this fortress...

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:31.720
No matter how many traps I set...

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:35.870
This fear of dying doesn't go away!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:39.570
Tell me, please!

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:43.840
How much more do I have to prepare?!

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.740
I'll end this for you, Theo!

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:29.270
Captain... Am I... going to die?

00:19:31.260 --> 00:19:33.630
I see...

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:39.460
In that case... I guess I don't 
need to be scared anymore.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:46.660
This feels nice... I don't feel 
scared of anything anymore...

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:51.530
It's like I've gone back to 
how I was before the war...

00:19:57.510 --> 00:19:59.750
You can rest now, Theo.

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:22.360
<i>The Beast Hunter...</i>

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:25.180
<i>The one who kills Incarnates,</i>

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:27.530
<i>Beasts who were once regarded as heroes.</i>

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:32.520
<i>What did my father say to him back then?</i>

00:20:33.180 --> 00:20:35.760
<i>Words filled with hatred? Regret?</i>

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:38.690
<i>Or...</i>

00:22:31.380 --> 00:22:35.060
The Incarnate Extermination Squad,
 Coup de Grâce...

00:22:35.590 --> 00:22:38.510
The squad that hunts the Beasts 
threatening our people.

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:45.290
What do you think of our new hero, President?

00:22:48.100 --> 00:22:49.870
Captain Claude.

00:22:49.870 --> 00:22:52.690
Your face seems a bit stern.

00:22:52.690 --> 00:22:54.480
You're going to frighten everyone.

00:22:54.480 --> 00:22:56.130
Why not try smiling a bit?

00:22:56.790 --> 00:23:00.430
I'll only smile after every last 
Beast has been hunted down!

00:23:12.650 --> 00:23:14.990
A girl, eh?

00:23:17.030 --> 00:23:21.480
It appears that fate continues 
to be on your side, Hank.

00:23:25.270 --> 00:23:29.790
It measures 219 meters long. 
It's the largest in the continent.

00:23:29.790 --> 00:23:32.060
It's moving much faster than expected.

00:23:32.060 --> 00:23:33.340
Fire! Fire!

00:23:33.340 --> 00:23:34.850
Why didn't you finish it off immediately?!

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:39.270
He's also a person trying to 
live in this peaceful age!

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:39.970
March of the Behemoth
